{{>head}}<header><div class="bar">{{>brand}}</div></header><main class="narrow"><section class="panel"><h1>관리자 로그인</h1><p>총학생회 물품 대여 관리</p><form method="post" action="/login"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{token}}"><label>아이디<input name="username" required autocomplete="username" autofocus></label><label>비밀번호<input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label>{{#loginError}}<p role="alert">아이디와 비밀번호를 확인해 주세요.</p>{{/loginError}}<button class="primary wide">로그인</button></form></section></main></body></html>
